# Everglade v2's bindings for coax/web/wgsl-module.coax (NAME GROUP BINDING [uniform VEC4FS]), as coax/web/host.js lays them out:
# group 0 the frame's uniforms and the frame store (host.js: the tokens and squares); group 1 the scene: the pack's vertices, the stores (the figures'
# instances, the baked clips, the visible kit pieces, the characters' materials, the ground's table and bake), the pack's layers and their sampler,
# then its linear data layers (normal and ORM maps, host.js PACK_DATA_LAYER).
u 0 0 uniform 52
frame 0 1
vertices 1 0
objects 1 1
bake 1 2
inst 1 3
mats 1 4
ground 1 5
sheets 1 6
sheet 1 7
data 1 8
shadow_map 2 0
shadow_cmp 2 1
bloom_src 1 0
bloom_lin 1 1
bloom_step 1 2 uniform 1
post_light 1 0
post_quarter 1 1
post_eighth 1 2
post_aux 1 3
post_depth 1 4
post_lin 1 5

sans_atlas 0 2
sans_sampler 0 3
